{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_006","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"[Submitted on 15 Apr 2021 ( v1 ), last revised 30 Nov 2021 (this version, v4)]","location_hint":"paragraph 17","char_start":803,"char_end":881,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_007","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"Title: Robust Optimization for Multilingual Translation with Imbalanced Data","location_hint":"paragraph 18","char_start":885,"char_end":961,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_008","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"Authors: Xian Li , Hongyu Gong","location_hint":"paragraph 19","char_start":965,"char_end":995,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_009","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"View a PDF of the paper titled Robust Optimization for Multilingual Translation with Imbalanced Data, by Xian Li and 1 other authors","location_hint":"paragraph 20","char_start":999,"char_end":1131,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_010","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"Abstract: Multilingual models are parameter-efficient and especially effective in improving low-resource languages by leveraging crosslingual transfer.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1145,"char_end":1296,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_011","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"Despite recent advance in massive multilingual translation with ever-growing model and data, how to effectively train multilingual models has not been well understood.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1297,"char_end":1464,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_012","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"In this paper, we show that a common situation in multilingual training, data imbalance among languages, poses optimization tension between high resource and low resource languages where the found multilingual solution is often sub-optimal for low resources.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1465,"char_end":1723,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_013","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"We show that common training method which upsamples low resources can not robustly optimize population loss with risks of either underfitting high resource languages or overfitting low resource ones.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1724,"char_end":1923,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_014","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"Drawing on recent findings on the geometry of loss landscape and its effect on generalization, we propose a principled optimization algorithm, Curvature Aware Task Scaling (CATS), which adaptively rescales gradients from different tasks with a meta objective of guiding multilingual training to low-curvature neighborhoods with uniformly low loss for all languages.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1924,"char_end":2289,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_015","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"We ran experiments on common benchmarks (TED, WMT and OPUS-100) with varying degrees of data imbalance.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":2290,"char_end":2393,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_016","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"CATS effectively improved multilingual optimization and as a result demonstrated consistent gains on low resources ($+0.8$ to $+2.2$ BLEU) without hurting high resources.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":2394,"char_end":2564,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_017","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"In addition, CATS is robust to overparameterization and large batch size training, making it a promising training method for massive multilingual models that truly improve low resource languages.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":2565,"char_end":2760,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_59b5d7b9e7e4_018","source_id":"src_59b5d7b9e7e4","source_hash":"c0c08dd9a23779a8c1867be90191f3e039c1c61d70d7a9c372b9f812cb940b11","text":"Computation and Language (cs.CL) ; Artificial Intelligence (cs.AI); Machine Learning (cs.LG)","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":2779,"char_end":2871,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:38:18.267Z"}
